00:13:29,990 --> 00:13:31,990
Speaker 1: Sertés, hasoldalas.

124
00:13:31,990 --> 00:13:34,990
Speaker 2: Ezen nincsen bőr, de rajta van a csont.

125
00:13:34,990 --> 00:13:40,330
